        "text": "Late Cretaceous",
        "sub": "70 to 75 million years ago"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gem-quality ammolite is mined commercially only in southern Alberta.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "mine",
        "place": "Southern Alberta, Canada",
        "tone": "#2fb59a",
        "zoomAt": 1.5
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Stacked layers of aragonite bend light into rainbow colors.",
